  "title": "Animula Nook — UGC Hub 1.0",
  "subtitle": "Cross-device journeys for discovery, creation and connection",
  "backgroundColor": "#f5ebd4",
  "summary": "Cross-device game UX and a working Web prototype for discovering, joining and creating player-made spaces.",
  "body": "Animula Nook is a life simulation game in a miniature world, where everyday objects become a home for building, decorating, exploring and spending time together. This case study focuses on UGC Hub 1.0, connecting player-created Home Design spaces, social spaces and streams through discovery, participation and interaction. My role covered cross-device UX for mobile touch, PC mouse and keyboard, and console controller input, alongside developing a Web prototype to explore task flows, focus paths, input feedback and interface behavior.",
